'''Dark Emperor Nyandam''' (悪の帝王ニャンダム, ''Aku no Teiō Nyandamu'', '''Evil Emperor Nyandam''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy first seen as the boss of the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon/Iriomote]] stage in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 2. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

