==Enemy==
He lacks speed in both movement and attack rate, but he boasts immense health, attack power and range. He has lower attack than [[The Face]] at 100% strength magnification, but his buff is 150% in his first appearance, giving him 149,998 health and 2,700 damage. It's important to note that Dark Emperor Nyandam's [[Hitbox]] is closer to the front of the sprite compared to [[Director Kurosawah]] and [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]], due to having lower range than them. Unlike Kurosawah, he also isn't a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy despite his name.

==Strategy==
When you first encounter him, prepare for a close fight, as he is protected by [[One Horn]]s and a constant spam of [[Squire Rel]]s and [[Those Guys]] (see the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]]'s article for strategies). Since few units available at this point can outrange him, focus on units that can survive his attacks, like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]].

Even later on, it's important to be wary of this enemy, as his strong, ranged attacks can put a dent in many cat armies, posing a huge danger especially to units with low health and not enough range to stay safe, like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. It certainly doesn't help that most [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] will not be able to properly fight him unless they get up close and beyond the enemies protecting him, but they do remain viable, such as in the case of [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]'s Long Distance or a [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]]'s [[Wave Attack]]s.

Nyandam and his variants often attack after a drawn-out forewsing animation. During this time, the [[Cat Cannon]] can be fired to force him to flinch, giving other units a chance to finish him. A stack of [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cats]] or [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]] can be used to stunlock him provided he's by himself, which can be used to cheese [[Last Gang]] when combined with your other anti-Red specialists.

