==Variants==
{{Variant
|original = Dark Emperor Nyandam
|Director Kurosawah
|Dark Emperor Nyandam's [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant, with higher attack damage and range. More glass cannon-oriented, generally having lower health than the buffed Dark Emperor Nyandams encountered around the same point in the game.
|Li'l Nyandam
|A smaller Red variant that has higher range, a faster attack rate and greater damage. Appears at the end of [[Stories of Legend]] sub-chapter 23, [[Dead End Night]], from which he can be unlocked as a [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]].
|Dark Emperor Santa
|A Christmas version of Nyandam with less health but more attack power, no delay between attacks and the ability to [[freeze]] the movement of [[Cat Units]]. Traited as [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]].
|Galactic Overseer Nyandam
|An [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] version of Nyandam that has a chance to [[slow]] Cat Units. He also has longer range and more damage.
|Satan Claus
|Another Alien variant, with health on par with normal Nyandam variants but much less range, a significantly shorter delay between attacks, faster movement speed and the ability to [[warp]] back Cat Units.
|Evil Emperor Cat
|The enemy version of [[Emperor Cat (Legend Rare Cat)|Emperor Cat]], a Nyandam-like [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy found in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Possessed by Evil (Merciless)|Prelude to Ruin]]. Deals relatively low damage but has an [[Omni Strike]] reaching up to 620 range, while also being able to do powerful [[Surge Attack]]s with both curse and freeze effects.
|Possessed Empress
|The [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy version of [[Princess Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Empress Cat]], with an extremely strong [[Shield]], piercing range and guaranteed [[Mini-Wave]]s and slow. Appears in [[Aku's Melody (Merciless)|Temptation's Symphony]].
|Infernal Tyrant Nyandam
|A standing Aku variant of Nyandam without a throne. Though he stands at only 400 range, he has extreme health and an attack that deals 666k damage in an area of 400 range, then hits for 30% Toxic damage within ranges of 500~800 and 1,000~1,250. Additionally, he is immune to to weaken, knockback and Surge Attacks. Appears in all 4 stages of [[Reign of the Tyrant]].
|Commander Nyandam
|A Nyandam variant introduced in 12th Anniversary stages, with a 100% chance to knockback cats.
